  "details": "1. Clean Windows install\n\n2. Install Steam (NOT SteamVR)\n\n3. Install and run VRChat\n\nAfter entering my 6 digit 2FA code, I was dumped into a blank screen with no loading indicators:\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/NuCTutn.png\n\nRestarting the game hangs on a slightly different screen:\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/ksok0Sn.png\n\nLooking at the logs, EAC was unable to load 'EOSSDK-Win64-Shipping.dll'. I was able to fix this myself by manually installing latest MSVC redistributable.",
